Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Aphrody Ecosystem Core Contributors <core@aphrody.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2), ca-certificates
Recommends: wireguard-tools
Suggests: bun
Homepage: https://aphrody.com
Description: Unified sovereign autonomous agent runtime and orchestrator
 Aphrody is a single high-performance native binary providing polyglot agent
 orchestration, MCP JSON-RPC protocol server integration, native terminal
 tools, and Cloudflare R2 / WireGuard mesh connectivity.
 Contains both 'aphrody' and 'yolo' symlinked commands.
